{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581920/extras/grafik.png?t=1753795565\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 brand-new missions \u2013 10 new challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the \u201cMission Pack,\u201d you expand <i>Heavy Cargo \u2013 The Truck Simulator</i> with 10 additional unlockable* heavy haulage missions featuring complete new types of cargo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether it\u2019s massive concrete elements, hefty steel beams, or as a special eye-catcher some truly unique pieces from prehistoric times that are sure to turn heads and cause some nervous steering on the roads.<br>Each mission presents you with new logistical challenges and puts your full skills as a Truck driver to the test. <br> <br><strong>Included in the DLC:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 unlockable* heavy haul missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New cargo types, including concrete elements, steel beams, and dinosaur sculptures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So get ready, start the engine, and aim for that 3-star rating!<br><br><i>*The DLC missions integrate into your current game progress and are unlocked based on the missions you've completed so far.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3581920?t=1753795565","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3581920?t=1753795565","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581920/032a2ba2bc5e86bef80262bbbb8e2800226079ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753795565","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581920/032a2ba2bc5e86bef80262bbbb8e2800226079ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753795565","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581920/extras/grafik.png?t=1753795565\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 brand-new missions \u2013 10 new challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the \u201cMission Pack,\u201d you expand <i>Heavy Cargo \u2013 The Truck Simulator</i> with 10 additional unlockable* heavy haulage missions featuring complete new types of cargo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether it\u2019s massive concrete elements, hefty steel beams, or as a special eye-catcher some truly unique pieces from prehistoric times that are sure to turn heads and cause some nervous steering on the roads.<br>Each mission presents you with new logistical challenges and puts your full skills as a Truck driver to the test. <br> <br><strong>Included in the DLC:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 unlockable* heavy haul missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New cargo types, including concrete elements, steel beams, and dinosaur sculptures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So get ready, start the engine, and aim for that 3-star rating!<br><br><i>*The DLC missions integrate into your current game progress and are unlocked based on the missions you've completed so far.</i></p>","developers":["tox\u00b2 interactive GmbH"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1474930","name":"Heavy Cargo - The Truck Simulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581920/885685c0aaa7aa226d3a7bf39175bf292d4e6901/header.jpg?t=1753795565"